camera    : live 128x128 RGB565, id 0x82, 16.0 MHz, expose 58 ms, read 16 ms, exposure settled after 41 frames
            mean RGB 7 0 7  (tuned camera on a neutral scene: about 115 107 105)
            ^ that is the bottom of the sensor's range after 41 frames of auto-exposure.
              If the room is not actually dark, the sensor has not started: check the lens cap,
